# Measured off art/back.jpg (credo, plate 1, first take, nothing lettered
# on it), as fractions of its width (728px): the blind-stamped shield
# with its five bars between 0.51 and 0.89, centred on the width; the
# darker band from 1.260 (0.896 of the height), 0.147 tall. Two rows
# (the install under the name) ran the legal line and the version off the
# foot, so the install goes beside the name, in one row, as db_admin. No frame on
# the plate, so the screenshots take the top of the face, two frames at
# the shots' own proportion (600x520), as health_probe set them.
